# The release's image needs the heart library, ARTIE, the report assets, the release exhibit and this folder.
*
!build-logic
!heart
!client
!docs/reports/assets
!exhibits/merge-watch-release
!kit/release
build-logic/build
heart/build
heart/*/build
client/build
client/*/build
**/.gradle
**/node_modules
client/runs
client/scripts
# Made on each machine, never sent: the app repository, recorded calls, GitLab's password and token, PlantUML.
exhibits/merge-watch-release/work
exhibits/merge-watch-release/gitlab/gitlab.env
exhibits/merge-watch-release/jenkins/jenkins.env
exhibits/merge-watch-release/tools
exhibits/merge-watch-release/smoke/runs
